0013: client.freeIdleManagedCopiesSec / freeIdleBufferCopiesSec: free only VirtualAlloc'd copies (64 KB and more); always fetch a freed MANAGED level, DISCARD or not; fail the lock when the fetch brings no whole copy instead of uploading an unfetched one; CRC32C check of texture fetches, as buffers have.
Applies after 0001-0012 on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only).
Also (review of dxvk-remix pull request 172): an idle pass frees only the presenting device's own copies, with a pass timer per device (two devices without D3DCREATE_MULTITHREADED share no lock); a copy is freeable only when its readback fits one server response including a wrap of the data ring (fitsOneServerResponse); D3DUSAGE_WRITEONLY buffers keep their copy (the server reads a freed copy back with D3DLOCK_READONLY).
